%% Pipeline flowchart
flowchart TD
  A[1. EDA\nSyntetos-Boylan, ACF] --> B[2. Feature Availability\nknown/partial/history/excluded]
  B --> C[3. Segmentation\nGMM/KMeans/HDBSCAN, hybrid dims]
